      "id": "mathematics-03-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The product of two numbers is 216. If their HCF is 6, what will be their LCM?",
      "options": {
        "A": "30",
        "B": "36",
        "C": "40",
        "D": "42"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "First Number × Second Number = HCF × LCM => 216 = 6 × LCM => LCM = 36",
      "hash": "e397e9183f4d4773",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो संख्याओं का गुणनफल 216 है। यदि उनका म.स.प. (HCF) 6 है, तो उनका ल.स.प. (LCM) क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "30",
            "B": "36",
            "C": "40",
            "D": "42"
          },
          "explanation": "पहली संख्या × दूसरी संख्या = HCF × LCM => 216 = 6 × LCM => LCM = 36"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "What is the difference between the Place Value and Face Value of 7 in the number 4732?",
      "options": {
        "A": "693",
        "B": "700",
        "C": "7",
        "D": "0"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Place Value = 700, Face Value = 7. Difference = 700 - 7 = 693",
      "hash": "93542d09a0abe76d",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "संख्या 4732 में 7 के स्थानीय मान (Place Value) और अंकित मान (Face Value) का अंतर क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "693",
            "B": "700",
            "C": "7",
            "D": "0"
          },
          "explanation": "स्थानीय मान = 700, अंकित मान = 7। अंतर = 700 - 7 = 693"
        }
      }
    },
