        "A": "15",
        "B": "20",
        "C": "25",
        "D": "30"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Sum of three = 15 × 3 = 45. Third number = 45 - 25 = 20",
      "hash": "04cc996e36044248",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "तीन संख्याओं का औसत 15 है। यदि पहली दो संख्याओं का योग 25 है, तो तीसरी संख्या क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "15",
            "B": "20",
            "C": "25",
            "D": "30"
          },
          "explanation": "तीनों का योग = 15 × 3 = 45। तीसरी संख्या = 45 - 25 = 20"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-014",
      "number": 14,
      "question": "What is the difference between CI and SI on Rs 7500 at 4% per annum for 2 years?",
      "options": {
        "A": "10",
        "B": "12",
        "C": "15",
        "D": "20"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Difference = P(R/100)² = 7500 × (4/100) × (4/100) = 7500 × (16/10000) = 12",
      "hash": "fc421447273a3cab",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "7500 रुपये का 4% वार्षिक दर से 2 साल का चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज और साधारण ब्याज का अंतर क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "10",
            "B": "12",
            "C": "15",
            "D": "20"
          },
          "explanation": "अंतर = P(R/100)² = 7500 × (4/100) × (4/100) = 7500 × (16/10000) = 12"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-015",
      "number": 15,
      "question": "A train is running at 90 km/hr. It crosses a pole in 10 seconds. Find the length of the train.",
      "options": {
        "A": "200 m",
        "B": "250 m",
        "C": "300 m",
        "D": "150 m"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Speed (m/s) = 90 × (5/18) = 25 m/s. Distance = 25 × 10 = 250 m",
      "hash": "73823fc1454b060c",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक ट्रेन 90 किमी/घंटा की गति से चल रही है। वह एक खंभे को 10 सेकंड में पार करती है। ट्रेन की लंबाई ज्ञात करें।",
          "options": {
            "A": "200 मीटर",
            "B": "250 मीटर",
            "C": "300 मीटर",
            "D": "150 मीटर"
          },
          "explanation": "गति (मी/से) = 90 × (5/18) = 25 मी/से। दूरी = 25 × 10 = 250 मीटर"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-016",
      "number": 16,
      "question": "The base of a right-angled triangle is 3 cm and height is 4 cm. What will be its hypotenuse?",
      "options": {
        "A": "5 cm",
        "B": "6 cm",
        "C": "7 cm",
        "D": "8 cm"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Pythagoras theorem: √(3² + 4²) = √(9 + 16) = √25 = 5",
      "hash": "636d4fbf70d71180",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक समकोण त्रिभुज का आधार 3 सेमी और ऊंचाई 4 सेमी है। इसका कर्ण (hypotenuse) क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "5 सेमी",
            "B": "6 सेमी",
            "C": "7 सेमी",
            "D": "8 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "पाइथागोरस प्रमेय: √(3² + 4²) = √(9 + 16) = √25 = 5"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-017",
      "number": 17,
      "question": "Two numbers are in the ratio 3:5 and their sum is 80. Find the larger number.",
      "options": {
        "A": "30",
        "B": "40",
        "C": "50",
        "D": "60"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "3x + 5x = 80 => 8x = 80 => x = 10. Larger number = 5 × 10 = 50",
      "hash": "49710c016abfcf88",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो संख्याओं का अनुपात 3:5 है और उनका योग 80 है। बड़ी संख्या ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "30",
            "B": "40",
            "C": "50",
            "D": "60"
          },
          "explanation": "3x + 5x = 80 => 8x = 80 => x = 10। बड़ी संख्या = 5 × 10 = 50"
        }
      }
    },
